How sure: moderate. The link to Kestrel is strong. Whether workload or supervision is the cause is not yet established, and recorded hours may understate late-night work.

What to do next: do not pay the group-wide retention payment or close the review yet, since it would not address the cause and would hide the signal. Commission the confidential interviews, structured to separate supervision from workload, before choosing between moving supervision or adding review capacity. Start adding matter and supervisor fields to attrition reporting now.","methodChoice":"Collected X7 (matter and supervisor records) and X9 (recorded hours); stopped at two items."}
